      "content": "Those are a good start, but they're a bit too brief for the full listings. Can you actually write out the full descriptions? Like, give me 2-3 paragraphs for each. \n\nI want to make sure the tone is totally distinct for each locale so we hit the right demographic. For the Oak Ridge one, really lean into that sense of tradition, legacy, and being \"above it all.\" For the West End one, lean into the \"edge\" and the character of the area. I want them to feel very different from each other.",
